# Arvo (o9 Design System) packages come from the o9UI Azure Artifacts feed.
# This file contains NO credentials - it only points the @arvo scope at the feed.
#
# Each developer authenticates once on their own machine; see README "One-time
# setup". Never commit a PAT or _password to this file.
#
# The top-level `always-auth` that older o9 repos carry is deprecated in npm 9+
# and warns on every install. It is not needed: the per-registry `:always-auth`
# lines in your USER ~/.npmrc are what actually authenticate the feed.
@arvo:registry=https://pkgs.dev.azure.com/o9git/_packaging/o9UI/npm/registry/
